7,"Siane, Koreipa in Papua New Guinea people group profile ...",https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/14932,"The Siane, also known as Koreipa (sometimes called Lambau in linguistic listings), live mainly in the Eastern Highlands and Chimbu (Simbu) Provinces of Papua New Guinea, particularly in areas such as Nambaiyufa and Goroka districts.",Siane,Trans-New Guinea
